==Battleground==
*4 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.
**7 [[Zroco]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**1 [[Zackie Peng]] spawns.
**2 [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is incredibly easy. The zombies are at 30% magnification, so you can easily blitz it. Think of this kind of like EoC Moon 1, but with fewer supporting enemies.

